meta {
  name: Get Trip Day
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/trip-days/1
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  # Get Trip Day

  Get detailed information about a specific trip day.

  ## URL Params
  - `{trip_day_id}`: ID of the trip day to retrieve

  ## Response
  Returns full trip day details including:
  - Basic info (id, date, day_number, day_type, title)
  - Location details (place, city, country, timezone)
  - Transit information (mode, details, arrival/departure times)
  - Accommodation details (name, address, checkin/checkout, confirmation)
  - Activities array (full details for each activity)
  - Bookings array (full details for each booking)
  - Weather forecast (if available)
  - Notes
  - Timestamps (created_at, updated_at)

  ## Access Control
  - Must have access to the parent trip (owner or collaborator in Phase 2)
}
